{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-rev-3-1","title":"Revelation 3:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The angel of the church of Sardis is reproved; 3 exhorted to repent, and threatened if he do not repent. 8 The angel of the church of Philadelphia, 10 is approved for his diligence and patience; 15 the angel of Laodicea rebuked for being neither hot nor cold, 19 and admonished to be more zealous. 20 Christ stands at the door and knocks.</p>\n<p>unto. 1:11,20 he that. 1:4; 4:5; 5:6; Joh 1:16,33; 3:34; 7:37-39; 15:26,27; 20:22; Ac 2:33 1Pe 1:11 and the. 1:16,20; 2:1 I know. 2:2,9,13,19 and art. Lu 15:24,32; Eph 2:1,5; Col 2:13; 1Ti 5:6; Jas 2:26; Jude 1:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-2","title":"Revelation 3:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>watchful. 16:15; Isa 56:10; 62:6,7; Eze 34:8-10,16; Zec 11:16; Mt 24:42-51 Mt 25:13; Mr 13:33-37; Ac 20:28-31; 2Ti 4:1-4; 1Pe 4:7; 5:8 strengthen. 2:4; De 3:28; Job 4:4-5; 16:5; Isa 35:3; Lu 22:31,32; Ac 18:23 thy works. 1Ki 11:4; 15:3; 2Ch 25:2; Isa 57:12; Da 5:27; Mt 6:2-4; 23:5,28-38</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-3","title":"Revelation 3:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>Remember. 2:5; Eze 16:61-63; 20:43; 36:31; Heb 2:1; 2Pe 1:13; 3:1 and hold. 11; 2:25; 1Ti 6:20; 2Ti 1:13 repent. 19; 2:5,21,22 I will. 16:15; Mt 24:42,43; Lu 12:39,40; 1Th 5:2,4,5,6; 2Pe 3:10 know. Mt 25:13; Mr 13:33,36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-4","title":"Revelation 3:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>names. 11:13; *Gr: Ac 1:15 even. 1Ki 19:18; Isa 1:9; Ro 11:4-6 which. 7:14; 19:8; Isa 52:1; 59:6; 61:3,10; 64:6; Zec 3:3-6; Jude 1:23 walk. 5,18; 4:4; 6:11; 7:9,13; 19:14; Es 8:15; Ps 68:14; Ec 9:8; Zec 3:4 Mr 16:5 for. Mt 10:11; Lu 20:35; 21:36; 2Th 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-5","title":"Revelation 3:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>that. 2:7; 1Sa 17:25 the same. 4; 19:8 blot. Ex 32:32,33; De 9:14; Ps 69:28; 109:13 the book. 13:8; 17:8; 20:12,15; 21:27; 22:19; Php 4:3 confess. Mal 3:17; Mt 10:32; Lu 12:8; Jude 1:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-7","title":"Revelation 3:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>to the. 1:11; 2:1 Philadelphia.Philadelphia, so called for its founder, Attalus Philadelphus, still exists in the town called Allahshehr, \"the city of God,\" \"a column in a scene of ruins.\" It is situated on the slopes of three or four hills, the roots of mount Tmolus, by the river Cogamus, twenty seven miles E. S. E. from Sardis, about long. 28 degrees 40', lat. 38 degrees 23'. The number of houses is said to be about 3,000, of which 250 are Greek, the rest Turkish; and the Christians have twenty-five places of worship, five of them large and regular churches, a resident bishop, and twenty inferior clergy.</p>\n<p>he that is holy. 4:8; 6:10; Ps 16:10; 89:18; 145:17; Isa 6:3; 30:11; 41:14,16,20; 47:4 Isa 48:17; 49:7; 54:5; 55:5; Mr 1:24; Lu 4:34; Ac 3:14 he that is true. 14; 1:5; 6:10; 15:3; 16:7; 19:2,11; 21:5; Mt 24:35; Joh 14:6; 1Jo 5:20 the key. 1:18; Isa 22:22; Lu 1:32 he that openeth. 5:3-5,9; Job 11:10; 12:14; Mt 16:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-8","title":"Revelation 3:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>I know. 1,15; 2:2 an open. 7; 1Co 16:9; 2Co 2:12; Col 4:3 a little. Da 11:34; 2Co 12:8-10; Php 4:13 and hast kept. 10; 22:7; Joh 14:21-24; 15:20; 17:6; 2Ti 4:7 and hast not. 2:13; Pr 30:9; Mt 26:70-72; Lu 12:9; Ac 3:13,14; 1Ti 5:8 1Jo 2:22,23; Jude 1:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-9","title":"Revelation 3:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>the synagogue. 2:9 I will make them to. Ex 11:8; 12:30-32; 1Sa 2:36; Es 8:17; Job 42:8-10; Isa 49:23; 60:14 Zec 8:20-23; Ac 16:37-39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-10","title":"Revelation 3:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>the word. 1:9; 13:10; 14:12 I also. Mt 6:13; 26:41; 1Co 10:13; Eph 6:13; 2Pe 2:9 all. Mt 24:14; Mr 14:9; Lu 2:1; Ro 1:8 to try. Isa 24:17; Da 12:10; Zec 13:9; Jas 3:12; 1Pe 4:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-11","title":"Revelation 3:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>I come. 1:3; 22:7,12,20; Zep 1:14; Php 4:5; Jas 5:9 hold. 3; 2:13,25 thy. 2:10; 4:4,10; 1Co 9:25; 2Ti 2:5; 4:8; Jas 1:12; 1Pe 5:3,4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-12","title":"Revelation 3:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>overcometh. 2:7; 17:14; 1Jo 2:13,14; 4:4 pillar. 1Ki 7:21; Jer 1:18; Ga 2:9 I will. 2:17; 14:1; 22:4 the city. 21:2,10-27; Ps 48:8; 87:3; Ga 4:26,27; Heb 12:22 my new. 22:4; Isa 65:15; Eph 3:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-14","title":"Revelation 3:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>the angel. 1:11; 2:1 of the Laodiceans. or, in Laodicea. Col 2:1; 4:16 the Amen. Isa 65:16; 2Co 1:20 the faithful. 7; 1:5; 19:11; 22:6; Isa 55:4; Jer 42:5 the beginning. Col 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-15","title":"Revelation 3:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>I know. 1; 2:2 that. 2:4; Mt 24:12; Php 1:9; 2Th 1:3; 1Pe 1:22 I would. De 5:29; Ps 81:11-13; 2Co 12:20 thou. Jos 24:15-24; 1Ki 18:21; Pr 23:26; Ho 7:8; 10:2; Zep 1:5,6; Mt 6:24 Mt 10:37; Lu 14:27,28; 1Co 16:22; Jas 1:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-16","title":"Revelation 3:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>I will spue thee out. 2:5; Jer 14:19; 15:1-4; Zec 11:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-17","title":"Revelation 3:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>I am. 2:9; Pr 13:7; Ho 12:8; Zec 11:5; Lu 1:53; 6:24; 18:11,12; Ro 11:20,25 Ro 12:3; 1Co 4:8-10 have need. De 8:12-14; Pr 30:9; Jer 2:31; Mt 9:12 knowest. Ro 2:17-23 wretched. Mt 5:3; Ro 7:24 blind. Isa 42:19; Joh 9:40,41; 2Pe 1:9 naked. 16:15; Ge 3:7,10,11; Ex 32:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-18","title":"Revelation 3:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>counsel. Ps 16:7; 32:8; 73:24; 107:11; Pr 1:25,30; 19:20; Ec 8:2 buy. Pr 23:23; Isa 55:1; Mt 13:44; 25:9 gold. Mal 3:3; 1Co 3:12,13; 1Pe 1:7 that thou. 2:9; Lu 12:21; 2Co 8:9; 1Ti 6:18; Jas 2:5 white. 4,5; 7:13; 16:15; 19:8; 2Co 5:3 the shame. 16:15; Isa 47:3; Jer 13:26; Da 12:2; Mic 1:11; Na 3:5 anoint. Joh 9:6-11; 1Jo 2:20-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-19","title":"Revelation 3:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":3,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>many. De 8:5; 2Sa 7:14; Job 5:17; Ps 6:1; 39:11; 94:10; Pr 3:11,12; 15:10 Pr 15:32; 22:15; Isa 26:16; Jer 2:30; 7:28; 10:24; 30:11; 31:18 Zep 3:2; 1Co 11:32; 2Co 6:9; Heb 12:5-11; Jas 1:12 be. Nu 25:11-13; Ps 69:9; Joh 2:17; Ro 12:11; 2Co 7:11; Ga 4:18 Tit 2:14 repent. 2:5,21,22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-rev-3-20","title":"Revelation 3:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"REV","chapterStart":3,"vers